  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to reduce poverty and improve food security, nutrition and climate resilience in the island rural communities. The project objective is to increase and diversify incomes and enhanced resilience of island rural communities with sustainable access to diversified food and nutritious diets.</narrative>
